🏠 Housing Price Analysis Dashboard | Power BI
📌 Project Overview

This project was completed as part of my Data Analytics Internship at Codveda Technologies. The objective was to analyze residential housing data to identify the key factors influencing property values and provide actionable insights through an interactive Power BI dashboard.

The dashboard enables users to explore housing trends, neighborhood characteristics, socio-economic indicators, and property features that impact median house prices.

🎯 Objectives
Analyze housing market trends.
Identify factors affecting house prices.
Build interactive dashboards for business decision-making.
Apply Power BI best practices using DAX, Power Query, and data modeling.
